  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br>1단원 미래직업을 조사하고 15년 뒤 자신의 미래 명함을 만들어 서로 나누는 수업을 해 보았습니다.</p><p>그리고 과학자에 대해 조사하고 과학자 홍보포스터를 만드는 김에 과학의 달 행사로 과학자 맞추기 캠페인을 할 예정입니다.</p><p>학생들이 수업 시간에 열심히 만든 것으로 아침등교 과학자 맞추기 캠페인에도 활용하게 되어 1학년이 이익을 볼꺼 같네요^^</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2753315058D851250E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"670\" height=\"900\" style=\"width: 670px; height: 900px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083106402.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"810\"  id=\"A_2753315058D851250E8D52\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234B905058D8512514\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"599\" height=\"335\" style=\"width: 599px; height: 335px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083110335.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_234B905058D8512514D901\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2348455058D8512616\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"599\" height=\"905\" style=\"width: 599px; height: 905px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083116125.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"810\"  id=\"A_2348455058D8512616FEBD\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25471B5058D8512616\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"606\" height=\"923\" style=\"width: 606px; height: 923px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083119634.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"810\"  id=\"A_25471B5058D85126163B2A\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2257FF5058D851290A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"596\" height=\"695\" style=\"width: 596px; height: 695px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083114000.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"810\"  id=\"A_2257FF5058D851290AFEEB\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21618D5058D8512A01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"594\" height=\"680\" style=\"width: 594px; height: 680px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_083114954.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"810\"  id=\"A_21618D5058D8512A015A9E\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/232F174F58D854F21B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"390\" height=\"568\" style=\"width: 390px; height: 568px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_084958399.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_232F174F58D854F21B73F4\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/222D374F58D854F61D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"396\" height=\"568\" style=\"width: 396px; height: 568px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170327_084959585.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"320\"  id=\"A_222D374F58D854F61D8FBD\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D96%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20170327084151&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile265.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F221DEE4C58D84EB611B2D4')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 미래명함만들기.hwp</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
